  "notes": [
    "Reflexive -ER verb, irregular due to a spelling change: **c → zc before o/a**, the same pattern as *conocer→conozco* and *aparecer→aparezco*",
    "Only affects the yo form of the presente (fortalezco, not \"fortalezo\") and the entire subjuntivo presente (fortalezca, fortalezcas...); all other tenses are regular",
    "Regular past participle: **fortalecido**",
    "Non-reflexive form **fortalecer** means \"to strengthen (something/someone else)\"; the reflexive **fortalecerse** means \"to become stronger/to strengthen oneself\"",
    "Related noun/adjective: **la fuerza** (strength), **fuerte** (strong)",
    "Common usage: *fortalecerse física y mentalmente* (to strengthen oneself physically and mentally)"
  ],
